JC VERTICAL SPECTRUM / TARGET-WORD TRIAGE
SCOPE: exact characteristic-zero identities; nonradial three-component branch assumes a*b*c*d != 0
NONRADIAL_CONIC:
  A=a+b*x*y; B=c+d*x^3*A; U=x*A*B; P=(2*B-c)/x
  J(P,U)=-b*c^2; J(U,UP)=b*c^2*U
  vertical coefficient vector on (x,A,B)=(a*c^2,0,0)
  (P^2-4*d*U)*x^2=c^2; source recovery needs exactly quadratic x
  deck: x->-x, B->c-B, A->-A*B/(c-B)
  consequence: every birational symplectic target word preserves cover degree 2
EXPONENT_UNIQUENESS:
  J(P_n,U_n)=-b*[c^2+2*(3-n)*B_n*(B_n-c)]
  n=3 is the unique genuine d!=0 constant-response exponent
CUBIC_CARRIER_CONTROL:
  q=x*[x+3*x*t-1]; p=-[x+3*x*t+1]/(3*q); addresses (-1/3,-2/3)
  inverse: x=-q/(3*p*q+2), t=(3*p*q+1)*(3*p*q+2)/(3*q)-1/3
  consequence: unequal residues do not obstruct arbitrary rational target maps
